<view class="page">
 <view class="eyebrow">ZHIBAN · 班主任工作平台</view><view class="title">今天，也从容一点。</view><view class="subtitle">{{today}} · {{settings.className}} · {{settings.termName}}</view>
 <view wx:if="error" class="warning">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="demo" class="warning row"><view class="min-width">正在展示示例资料，可自由体验。</view><view class="link nowrap" bindtap="clearDemo">清空示例</view></view>
 <view class="card green"><view class="muted">每日一句 · {{quote.kind}}</view><view class="quote">{{quote.text}}</view><view class="muted">你的认真，值得被看见。</view></view>
 <view wx:if="meetingNudge" class="warning row" bindtap="meeting"><view class="min-width">本周班会主题还没有记录，花一分钟记下来吧。</view><view class="link nowrap">去记录 →</view></view><view class="stat-grid"><view class="stat"><view class="stat-label">今天待办</view><view class="stat-number">{{todayCount}}</view><view class="small-text">把重要的事放在前面</view></view><view class="stat"><view class="stat-label">本周已完成</view><view class="stat-number">{{stats.completed}}</view><view class="small-text">每一步都留下了积累</view></view></view>
 <view class="actions"><button class="primary small" bindtap="add">＋ 新建待办</button><button class="secondary small" bindtap="import">识别通知 / 周程</button><button class="secondary small" bindtap="incident">随手记事</button><button class="secondary small" bindtap="meeting">记录班会</button></view>
 <view class="row"><view class="section">工作清单</view><view class="link" bindtap="sort">{{sort==='time'?'按时间排序':'按轻重缓急'}} ⇅</view></view>
 <view class="tabs"><view class="tab {{tab==='today'?'selected':''}}" data-tab="today" bindtap="tab">今天</view><view class="tab {{tab==='overdue'?'selected':''}}" data-tab="overdue" bindtap="tab">逾期 {{overdueCount}}</view><view class="tab {{tab==='all'?'selected':''}}" data-tab="all" bindtap="tab">全部待办</view><view class="tab {{tab==='done'?'selected':''}}" data-tab="done" bindtap="tab">已完成</view></view>
 <view class="card"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="task"><view class="row"><view class="circle {{item.status==='done'?'active':''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggle">{{item.status==='done'?'✓':''}}</view><view class="min-width" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit"><view class="task-name {{item.status==='done'?'done':''}}">{{item.title}}</view><view class="meta">{{item.date || '待安排日期'}} {{item.time || '全天'}} · {{item.categoryName}}</view><view class="badge {{item.priority==='high'?'high':''}}">{{item.priorityName}}</view></view><view class="remind-circle" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remind"><view class="circle {{item.remind?'active':''}}">{{item.remind?'●':'○'}}</view><view class="remind-label">提醒</view></view></view></view><view wx:if="!items.length" class="empty">这里暂时没有工作。留一点时间给自己。</view></view>
 <view class="row"><view class="section">需要你留意</view><view class="link" bindtap="archives">查看档案 →</view></view><view class="card"><view wx:for="{{followUps}}" wx:key="id" class="task" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="student"><view class="task-name">学生 {{item.code}} · 待跟进</view><view class="meta">约定跟进日期 {{item.date}}</view></view><view wx:for="{{incidents}}" wx:key="id" class="task" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="event"><view class="task-name">{{item.title}}</view><view class="meta">{{item.status==='open'?'正在处理':'等待复查'}} · {{item.date}}</view></view><view wx:if="unrecorded" class="task" bindtap="archives"><view class="task-name">{{unrecorded}} 场班会待确认开展情况</view><view class="meta">补全主题与内容，留下本周的教育记录。</view></view><view wx:if="!followUps.length &amp;&amp; !incidents.length &amp;&amp; !unrecorded" class="empty">暂时没有待跟进事项。</view></view>
 <view class="footer-note">本机保存 · 未连接云端 · 微信推送未配置</view>
</view>
